examples:
```text
int a { 11 }, b { 22 };
auto returnedValue = std::exchange(a, b);
```
执行后：
$$a=22,\quad b=22,\quad returnedValue=11$$

移动 `Spreadsheet` 的基本数据成员时：
```text
m_width = std::exchange(src.m_width, 0);
m_height = std::exchange(src.m_height, 0);
m_cells = std::exchange(src.m_cells, nullptr);
```
